---
import { coachingUrl } from '~/data/offers';
---

<section class="v6-section v6-closing" data-tone="light" data-bg="moon-50" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
  <div class="v6-container v6-container--narrow" data-reveal>
    <h2 id="closing-title" class="v6-h2"><span>有想落地的 AI 场景？</span><span>先聊一小时。</span></h2>
    <p class="v6-lead">带上你的项目和问题，一小时内拆清楚现状，给出能马上执行的方案。</p>
    <div class="v6-closing__actions">
      <a class="v6-btn v6-btn--primary" href="/links#offers">预约咨询</a>
      <a class="v6-btn v6-btn--secondary" href={coachingUrl}>发邮件沟通陪跑</a>
    </div>
    <a class="v6-closing__more" href="/opensource">
      先看看我的开源项目 <span class="v6-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .v6-closing {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .v6-closing .v6-h2 {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4.6vw, 64px);
    line-height: 1.22;
  }
  .v6-closing .v6-h2 span {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .v6-closing .v6-h2 span {
    display: block;
  }
  .v6-closing .v6-lead {
    margin-top: 24px;
    color: var(--v6-fg-3);
  }
  .v6-closing__more {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--copper);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .v6-closing__actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .v6-closing .v6-h2 span {
      display: block;
    }
    .v6-closing__actions {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
